{"w":2400,"lines":[{"w":0.12823755900065104,"t":"Audioscripts","x":0.069918741610261556,"y":0.046934866971605094,"c":1,"h":0.016857487694767803},{"y":0.097048752052183107,"h":0.009390867953432136,"x":0.069993001762195001,"t":"HELEN:","w":0.051766573588053408,"c":1},{"x":0.14432990833876866,"y":0.094476744353003461,"h":0.015988371754420694,"w":0.71958760579427083,"c":1,"t":"Yes, there's nothing happening. Perhaps I should add the boy - Malcolm, isn't it? He"},{"c":1,"h":0.017161196284761759,"t":"would be walking up to it.","x":0.14411448926642123,"y":0.10999980862153835,"w":0.21692125956217451},{"w":0.77319585164388016,"h":0.014534883616744931,"c":1,"x":0.068041249336967272,"t":"JEREMY: Yes, ers haye Malcolm in the drawing. And what about putting in a tiger - the one","y":0.12790697679396423},{"c":1,"x":0.14432989653888606,"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"that he makes friends with a bit later? Maybe it could be sitting under a tree washing","y":0.14386376955534819,"w":0.71546391805013021},{"x":0.87422680484636961,"c":1,"w":0.039175256093343047,"t":"Q22","h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.12790697663819084},{"w":0.053715063730875645,"t":"HELEN:","h":0.011874576911321544,"c":1,"y":0.17720224640331939,"x":0.067987828842532974},{"h":0.014679976512037674,"y":0.17586611846868416,"w":0.6845360819498697,"t":"And the tiger stops in the middle of what it's doing when it sees Malcolm walking","x":0.14432989706243624,"c":1},{"x":0.14331940498093623,"w":0.046855681737263982,"h":0.014424619153885709,"c":1,"y":0.19239675217498664,"t":"past."},{"t":"JEREMY:","w":0.063917522430419926,"x":0.068041239437710954,"h":0.010174418083724102,"c":1,"y":0.20930232567228524},{"c":1,"x":0.14226804163775911,"t":"That's a good idea.","w":0.16907216389973959,"y":0.20784883713412383,"h":0.013081395479068947},{"x":0.069995821919028312,"y":0.22643169711263078,"w":0.049699077606201181,"t":"HELEN:","h":0.0093459080613786938,"c":1},{"h":0.016147974163241319,"c":1,"w":0.2144329833984375,"t":"OK, I'Il have a go at that.","x":0.14432989964891765,"y":0.22372284188247415},{"h":0.01051805443576137,"w":0.064026018778483074,"y":0.24256074009416828,"t":"JEREMY:","c":1,"x":0.067986991099057786},{"t":"Then there's the drawing of the crowd of men and women dancing. They re just","y":0.23839991050685216,"h":0.017437172720030536,"c":1,"x":0.13809200119786888,"w":0.68877731323242186},{"x":0.87422680484636961,"w":0.039175256093343047,"c":1,"t":"Q23","h":0.013081395479068947,"y":0.23837209291726058},{"t":"outside the forest, and there's a lot going on.","h":0.018691188926495239,"x":0.14217998063404608,"y":0.2532971933647129,"w":0.3837265777587891,"c":1},{"x":0.070103092332007552,"h":0.0087209299460482281,"c":1,"t":"HELEN:","w":0.051546392440795896,"y":0.27470930245066771},{"x":0.14432988658393478,"t":"That's right, you wanted them to be watching a carnival procession, but I thought it","y":0.27180232574822938,"w":0.70309280395507812,"h":0.015988371754420583,"c":1},{"c":1,"y":0.28772753961927977,"w":0.45567011515299483,"h":0.014679976512037562,"x":0.14432989078381198,"t":"would be too crowded. Do you think it works like this?"},{"w":0.06615067799886068,"x":0.065893733066903992,"y":0.30644007001124995,"t":"JEREMY:","h":0.012119859929513255,"c":1},{"t":"Yes, I like what you've done. The only thing is, could you add Malcolm to it, without","x":0.14432990519383584,"y":0.30523255818949013,"c":1,"w":0.70515462239583337,"h":0.014534883616744709},{"w":0.26597938537597654,"h":0.014679976512037562,"x":0.14226803915166741,"y":0.32119788585493247,"c":1,"t":"changing what's already there."},{"c":1,"x":0.068041236670495525,"y":0.33866279082276085,"t":"HELEN:","w":0.051546392440795896,"h":0.0087209299460482281},{"t":"JEREMY:","c":1,"x":0.068006289701065106,"y":0.35454111584615111,"w":0.063987420399983716,"h":0.010394512452032045},{"t":"HELEN:","h":0.0087209299460482281,"y":0.3706395350088072,"c":1,"w":0.051546392440795896,"x":0.068041236670495525},{"c":1,"x":0.063896459770193814,"h":0.011750824368847113,"y":0.38656644825816655,"t":"JEREMY:","w":0.068083368937174482},{"h":0.015988371754420694,"x":0.1402061781229193,"t":"What about having him sitting on the tree trunk on the right of the picture?","c":1,"y":0.33575581412016864,"w":0.63298970540364574},{"t":"Yes, that would be fine.","x":0.14226804065906123,"y":0.35173223699739498,"w":0.20206185658772785,"h":0.016000320963207137,"c":1},{"t":"And do you want him watching the other people?","y":0.36768814059691768,"w":0.41872362772623695,"x":0.14219435914871406,"h":0.017322983800559855,"c":1},{"w":0.77132883707682276,"c":1,"y":0.38200486914078868,"h":0.021132367817850106,"x":0.14215755835352914,"t":"No, he's been left out of all the fun, so I'd like him to be crying - that ill contrast nicely Q24"},{"c":1,"t":"with the next picture, where he's laughing at the clowns in the carnival.","y":0.39769908549694855,"h":0.020517390682917136,"w":0.60435145060221351,"x":0.14010393101350493},{"y":0.41860465137700686,"t":"HELEN:","w":0.051546392440795896,"h":0.010174418083724102,"x":0.068041236797408977,"c":1},{"t":"JEREMY:","w":0.063944638570149745,"c":1,"x":0.065965824950753107,"h":0.010259249738154508,"y":0.43455060766681908},{"t":"HELEN:","c":1,"x":0.065887400239295013,"y":0.45324241955877453,"h":0.010666323632124275,"w":0.053792209625244142},{"x":0.14226804034596904,"y":0.41715116283210296,"t":"Right, Ill do that.","w":0.14639175415039066,"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1},{"y":0.43305930701095563,"x":0.14226804270666737,"h":0.014679976512037562,"w":0.50721649169921879,"t":"And then the drawing of the people ice skating in the forest.","c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.71752573649088547,"t":"I wasn't too happy with that one. Because they're supposed to be skating on grass.","x":0.14226806424940264,"y":0.44767441871674252,"h":0.017441859892096456},{"t":"Q25","w":0.041237112681070998,"h":0.011627907341393184,"c":1,"x":0.87216494871707517,"y":0.44767441838812694},{"y":0.46451956098377079,"h":0.014968184394410833,"c":1,"x":0.14195833460401122,"w":0.10373455683390301,"t":"aren't they?"},{"t":"JEREMY:","y":0.48277013877796304,"w":0.066619536081949871,"c":1,"x":0.063682727229976477,"h":0.012438407311072819},{"h":0.010808167426780813,"c":1,"x":0.067918790093592377,"y":0.49822963709381085,"t":"HELEN:","w":0.051791286468505851},{"c":1,"t":"JEREMY:","y":0.51744186059383634,"w":0.065979379018147766,"x":0.065979382552781768,"h":0.0087209299460482281},{"h":0.015988371754420694,"t":"That's right, and it's frozen over. At the moment it doesn't look quite right.","w":0.62268040974934891,"c":1,"x":0.1422680479088306,"y":0.47965116280011522},{"x":0.14432990257063205,"w":0.45979380289713534,"y":0.49706400483751367,"t":"Mm, I see what you mean. I'll have another go at that.","c":1,"h":0.014679976512037562},{"w":0.77319585164388016,"t":"And I like the wool hats they're wearing. Maybe you could giye each of them a scar,. Q26","y":0.51162790723682705,"x":0.14020619884847538,"c":1,"h":0.017441859892096456},{"t":"as well.","y":0.53035559485911954,"w":0.066111806233723952,"h":0.013416716440663445,"c":1,"x":0.14220182921436442},{"c":1,"y":0.54786273669462371,"x":0.068006707298258459,"w":0.051615451176961272,"h":0.0089256893657475578,"t":"HELEN:"},{"c":1,"w":0.70927836100260411,"x":0.14226803587238265,"h":0.016147974163241319,"y":0.54492072828036608,"t":"Yeah, that's easy enough. They can be streaming out behind the people to suggest"},{"x":0.14201054761056692,"h":0.018402972644172011,"t":"they're skating really fast.","y":0.55916377971452613,"w":0.22116053263346352,"c":1},{"w":0.061855672200520836,"x":0.068041235965718969,"c":1,"y":0.57994186070523102,"h":0.010174418083724102,"t":"JEREMY:"},{"h":0.010243051274692161,"t":"HELEN:","w":0.055695304870605464,"y":0.59589591620289739,"x":0.063904924781141764,"c":1},{"h":0.016847092476719894,"c":1,"y":0.576223291084204,"w":0.35900853474934891,"t":"Mm, great. Well that's all on the drawings.","x":0.1421487416931122},{"c":1,"t":"Right. So you've finished writing your story and I just need to finish illustrating it, and","w":0.71752578735351558,"x":0.14226803404853949,"y":0.59302325553778346,"h":0.017441861012089777},{"h":0.014679976512037562,"t":"my story and your drawings are done.","x":0.14432990549795469,"w":0.3237113189697266,"c":1,"y":0.60892542575055753},{"w":0.051772219340006517,"y":0.65227237740374966,"x":0.063804611876876458,"h":0.0094087335269590344,"c":1,"t":"HELEN:"},{"h":0.01453488361674482,"c":1,"t":"So the next thing is to decide what exactly we need to write about in the report that","y":0.64970930237554914,"w":0.70927836100260411,"x":0.13814432455024425},{"w":0.52783503214518235,"h":0.016147974163241319,"y":0.66559013506415921,"c":1,"t":"goes with the stories, and how we're going to divide the work.","x":0.13814433948123295},{"y":0.68459302349932016,"h":0.010174418083723991,"x":0.063917527338054642,"w":0.063917522430419926,"c":1,"t":"JEREMY:"},{"x":0.063917525321698268,"t":"HELEN:","y":0.70058139547392362,"w":0.05154639244079591,"c":1,"h":0.0087209299460482281},{"c":1,"t":"Right, Helen.","w":0.11363625844319664,"x":0.14008908710107154,"h":0.015470465560975866,"y":0.68121825557100313},{"t":"What do you think about including a section on how we planned the project as a","y":0.69759248386227513,"x":0.13814433002923598,"h":0.014679976512037562,"c":1,"w":0.68453608194986981},{"h":0.017976306146967769,"w":0.41051862080891921,"c":1,"x":0.1380327605451791,"t":"whole, Jeremy? That's probably quite important.","y":0.7119673482837513},{"h":0.010620090307660202,"c":1,"t":"JEREMY:","w":0.064057553609212239,"x":0.063847512248350211,"y":0.7323353035843746},{"c":1,"h":0.017810367935906402,"w":0.78159993489583324,"t":"Yeah. Well. you've had most of the good ideas so far, How do you feel about drafting Q27","y":0.72820479981717512,"x":0.12983499867945134},{"t":"something, then we can go through it together and discuss it?","w":0.52602564493815096,"y":0.7448598833032033,"x":0.13802340112166198,"h":0.017220350972218745,"c":1},{"h":0.010682734894318591,"y":0.76282723703886057,"w":0.051743971506754555,"t":"HELEN:","c":1,"x":0.063818736346170399},{"c":1,"y":0.76159718124685161,"w":0.71958760579427083,"t":"OK, that seems reasonable. And I could include something on how we came up with","x":0.13814434132996667,"h":0.016147974163241319},{"t":"the ideas for our two stories, couldn't I?","h":0.015988371754420583,"y":0.77761627923366727,"c":1,"x":0.13814433085228045,"w":0.33814432779947917},{"h":0.010314027491696631,"c":1,"w":0.068083044687906893,"x":0.059772910542577148,"y":0.79644182344725534,"t":"JEREMY:"},{"t":"Well I've started writing something about that. so why donit you do the same and we. Q28","x":0.13402062398701589,"c":1,"h":0.017446981621572544,"y":0.79359953027678254,"w":0.77525772094726575},{"w":0.23123570760091144,"h":0.015878168891194422,"y":0.80977165205547719,"x":0.13800818813832799,"c":1,"t":"can include the two things."},{"c":1,"y":0.82848837221883631,"t":"HELEN:","h":0.0087209299460482281,"w":0.051546392440795896,"x":0.063917525325993818},{"y":0.82558139539774256,"w":0.6907216389973958,"h":0.014534883616744709,"c":1,"t":"Right. So what about our interpretation of the stories? Do we need to write about","x":0.13814433499081191},{"w":0.71958760579427083,"c":1,"h":0.016147974163241319,"t":"what we think they show, like the value of helping other people, all that sort of thing?","x":0.13814434134784107,"y":0.84145625348495978},{"w":0.068111260732014969,"h":0.011832873959857659,"x":0.059758802535994845,"y":0.86036263276571545,"t":"JEREMY:","c":1},{"h":0.020088985396075509,"w":0.7156812540690104,"x":0.13187311835237173,"y":0.85496287086524059,"c":1,"t":"That's going to come up later, isn't it? I think everyone in the class is going to read."},{"x":0.87010309346223191,"t":"Q29","w":0.039175256093343047,"y":0.85755813941030701,"h":0.013081395479068947,"c":1},{"t":"each other's stories and come up with their own interoretations, which we re going to","w":0.72164947509765631,"h":0.013211978860833917,"c":1,"x":0.13814433451615155,"y":0.87492660005034184},{"h":0.013252129501548859,"c":1,"x":0.13811418940323592,"t":"discuss.","y":0.89090300490631213,"w":0.074287083943684884},{"h":0.011848305227892375,"t":"HELEN:","y":0.90832003340680834,"c":1,"w":0.053703784942626953,"x":0.061807901226791154},{"w":0.54036549886067708,"x":0.13808331030130935,"c":1,"h":0.018083715186844262,"t":"Oh, I missed that. So it isn't going to be part of the report at all?","y":0.90500117503031108},{"t":"116","y":0.95494186033552286,"x":0.061855670484256296,"h":0.01453488361674482,"w":0.039175256093343096,"c":1},{"y":0.95433624935165651,"w":0.29142631530761715,"c":1,"x":0.35219444692405727,"t":"leltsresources.org","h":0.0225830727721128}],"h":3406}